task: explicit-alignment::conformance_tests
status: test
desc: Draft deterministic frontend, semantic, layout, binding-storage, and C ABI tests from the signed contract before implementation.
impl:
  - Add frontend coverage for #[alignas(N)] argument parsing and recognized noalias/likely/unlikely names in /home/diogo/Zith/tests/test-frontend.cpp.
  - Add TypeChecked diagnostics for invalid or duplicate alignas values, unsupported placements, generic-dependent values, and non-pointer noalias in /home/diogo/Zith/tests/test-parse-input.cpp.
  - Add the x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu layout fixture from ABI-ALIGN-01 to /home/diogo/Zith/tests/test-codegen.cpp.
  - Add an aligned [128]u8 binding check proving storage alignment changes while the type size remains 128, plus a C ABI rejection check for an unverified aligned record, in /home/diogo/Zith/tests/test-codegen.cpp.
  - Reserve cache and ZIRL round-trip assertions for explicit-alignment::runtime_and_cache, after the persistent metadata fields exist.
  - Keep tests deterministic and assert diagnostics by code or stable message text.
  - Run tests before production changes and record the expected red failures without marking this task done.
